      "id": "f9a1ea4931a3",
      "source": "Color nodes can be connected to color parameters.",
      "target": "颜色节点可以连接到颜色参数。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "f1685fdb00fd",
      "source": "The color of this parameter will then be controlled in the color node.",
      "target": "该参数的颜色随后会由颜色节点控制。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "65f072b9497a",
      "source": "A color parameter is recognized by the colored square next to it.",
      "target": "颜色参数可以通过其旁边的彩色方块来识别。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "96a147b504bd",
      "source": "The following are some examples of parameters that can be controlled by color nodes:",
      "target": "以下是一些可由颜色节点控制的参数示例：",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "69fe5a7a4095",
      "source": "To expose a color parameter pin for connecting a color node",
      "target": "若要公开用于连接颜色节点的颜色参数引脚，",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa84dd7d5dde",
      "source": "you have to set the override state to ",
      "target": "需要将覆盖状态设置为 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "b776122a654c",
      "source": "Pin Override",
      "target": "Pin Override",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "12e3148e5048",
      "source": " by ",
      "target": "，通过 ",
      "note": "stage 3B short-fragment fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "8feed1f8727a",
      "source": " clicking the icon next to the parameter.",
      "target": " 点击参数旁边的图标。",
      "note": "stage 3B audit fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca3761bd24ea",
      "source": "A color parameter can also have two squares next to it as with the ",
      "target": "颜色参数旁边也可能有两个方块，例如 ",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "365d6ab0fa92",
      "source": "Color: Constant",
      "target": "Color: Constant",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ca80ef5ac3c5",
      "source": " node. This means that the parameter also supports an alpha channel.",
      "target": " 节点就是如此。这表示该参数也支持 Alpha 通道。",
      "note": "stage 3B translation"
    },
